{title: Jaane Nahi Denge Tujhe}
{artist: Sonu Nigam}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] [A],        Jaane nahin denge tujhe
[G] [D],        Jaane tujhe denge nahin
[D] [G],        Chahe tujhko rab bulaa le
[D] [G],        Hum na rab se darne waale
[D] [G] [A],        Raahon mein dat ke khade hain hum
[D] [G],        Yaaron se nazrein chura le
[D] [G],        Chahe jitna dum lagaa le
[D] [G] [A],        Jaane na tujhko aise denge hum
[D] [A],        Jaane nahin denge tujhe
[G] [D],        Jaane tujhe denge nahin
[D] [G],        Do kadam ka yeh safar hai
[D] [G],        Umr chhoti si dagar hai
[D] [G] [A],        Ek kadam mein ladkhadaya kyoon
[D] [G],        Sunn le yaaron ki yeh baatein
[D] [G],        Beetengi sab ghum ki raatein
[D] [G] [A],        Yaaron se rootha hai saale kyoon
[D] [A],        Jaane nahin denge tujhe
[G] [D],        Jaane tujhe denge nahin
